      "name": "Mono LRGB M51 (Whirlpool) - L then RGB",
      "description": "Intermediate mono LRGB sequence for the Whirlpool Galaxy with a cooled CMOS camera (gain 120, offset 30, -10C). Captures 40 x 120s luminance frames first, then 20 x 60s for each of R, G, B. Autofocus refresh every 30 minutes and dither every 5 frames. Expected total time ~3 hr 30 min including overhead.",
